content":["Odstupite od mene, svi opaki, jer je Jahve plač moj čuo."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["Čuo je Jahve molbu moju, Jahve je primio moju molitvu."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Neka se postide i užasno zbune svi moji dušmani, i puni srama neka smjesta odstupe."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}